03:52.000 --> 04:01.000
You can do a lot with this opt. route. You can even accept parameters.

04:01.000 --> 04:06.000
You can give type hints for those parameters.

04:06.000 --> 04:15.000
You can specify which HTTP methods you want to accept in your route, for example, just get or just post.

04:15.000 --> 04:23.000
